{"id":"a9550fb0afb52328","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-zfc-tree11-subtree-restriction-to-levels.md","title":"ZFC Tree11 Subtree Restriction To Levels","display":"df-zfc-tree11-subtree-restriction-to-levels — ZFC Tree11 Subtree Restriction To Levels","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-tree11-subtree-restriction-to-levels","aliases":["58-df-zfc-tree11-subtree-restriction-to-levels"],"display":"df-zfc-tree11-subtree-restriction-to-levels — ZFC Tree11 Subtree Restriction To Levels","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-tree8-subtree.md]]","[[../batch06/58-df-zfc-ordinal2-ordinal-indexed-sequence.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-tree11-subtree-restriction-to-levels"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-tree11-subtree-restriction-to-levels</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-tree11-subtree-restriction-to-levels — ZFC Tree11 Subtree Restriction To Levels"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"336078cd2c28561e\" href=\"?note=336078cd2c28561e\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-zfc-tree8-subtree.md\">../batch07/58-df-zfc-tree8-subtree.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"44c6814fd2d8eda0\" href=\"?note=44c6814fd2d8eda0\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-zfc-ordinal2-ordinal-indexed-sequence.md\">../batch06/58-df-zfc-ordinal2-ordinal-indexed-sequence.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,T,L\\in V\">\\(S,T,L\\in V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(L\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree8Subtree}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree8Subtree}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span>（见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"336078cd2c28561e\" href=\"?note=336078cd2c28561e\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-zfc-tree8-subtree.md\">../batch07/58-df-zfc-tree8-subtree.md</a>）</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree11SubtreeRestrictionToLevels}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree11SubtreeRestrictionToLevels}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal2OrdinalIndexedSequence}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal2OrdinalIndexedSequence}_S\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"44c6814fd2d8eda0\" href=\"?note=44c6814fd2d8eda0\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-zfc-ordinal2-ordinal-indexed-sequence.md\">../batch06/58-df-zfc-ordinal2-ordinal-indexed-sequence.md</a>；序数索引函数的长度为其定义域，允许有限及超限长度。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree11\\text{-}subtree\\text{-}restriction\\text{-}to\\text{-}levels} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTree11SubtreeRestrictionToLevels}_S(S,T,L)\\leftrightarrow L\\subseteq\\omega\\land(\\forall m,n\\in\\omega\\;(m&lt;n\\land n\\in L\\to m\\in L))\\land(\\forall t\\in T\\;\\exists\\alpha,A\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal2OrdinalIndexedSequence}_S(t,\\alpha,A))\\land S=\\{t\\in T:\\operatorname{dom}(t)\\in L\\}\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTree8Subtree}_S(S,T)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree11\\text{-}subtree\\text{-}restriction\\text{-}to\\text{-}levels} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTree11SubtreeRestrictionToLevels}_S(S,T,L)\\leftrightarrow L\\subseteq\\omega\\land(\\forall m,n\\in\\omega\\;(m&lt;n\\land n\\in L\\to m\\in L))\\land(\\forall t\\in T\\;\\exists\\alpha,A\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal2OrdinalIndexedSequence}_S(t,\\alpha,A))\\land S=\\{t\\in T:\\operatorname{dom}(t)\\in L\\}\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTree8Subtree}_S(S,T)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>要在原前缀序下仍得到子树，所保留的层必须向下闭合；否则较长节点会失去其被删层上的前缀。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-zfc-tree8-subtree.md","status":"resolved","id":"336078cd2c28561e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-tree8-subtree.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-zfc-ordinal2-ordinal-indexed-sequence.md","status":"resolved","id":"44c6814fd2d8eda0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-zfc-ordinal2-ordinal-indexed-sequence.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-zfc-tree8-subtree.md","status":"resolved","id":"336078cd2c28561e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTree8Subtree}_S\\subseteq V^2$（见 [[../batch07/58-df-zfc-tree8-subtree.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-zfc-ordinal2-ordinal-indexed-sequence.md","status":"resolved","id":"44c6814fd2d8eda0","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal2OrdinalIndexedSequence}_S$ 使用 [[../batch06/58-df-zfc-ordinal2-ordinal-indexed-sequence.md]]；序数索引函数的长度为其定义域，允许有限及超限长度。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S,T,L\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"L\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTree8Subtree}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTree11SubtreeRestrictionToLevels}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal2OrdinalIndexedSequence}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree11\\text{-}subtree\\text{-}restriction\\text{-}to\\text{-}levels} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTree11SubtreeRestrictionToLevels}_S(S,T,L)\\leftrightarrow L\\subseteq\\omega\\land(\\forall m,n\\in\\omega\\;(m<n\\land n\\in L\\to m\\in L))\\land(\\forall t\\in T\\;\\exists\\alpha,A\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal2OrdinalIndexedSequence}_S(t,\\alpha,A))\\land S=\\{t\\in T:\\operatorname{dom}(t)\\in L\\}\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTree8Subtree}_S(S,T)","display":true}],"bytes":1517,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3802","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-tree11-subtree-restriction-to-levels.md|58-df-zfc-tree11-subtree-restriction-to-levels]]（batch09）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","336078cd2c28561e","44c6814fd2d8eda0"]}